<title>USA: Washington taxable housing bonds coupon set.</title>
<headline>Washington taxable housing bonds coupon set.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it set the coupon on the taxable component of Washington State Housing Finance Commission's $22 million bond deal.</p>
<p>The new pricing information follows:  </p>
