<p>COMMISSION SINGLE FAMILY PROGRAM BONDS,</p>
<p>RE: $22,300,000*</p>
<p>SERIES 3A (AMT) SERIES 3T (TAXABLE)</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING AND RESTRUCTURING.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
